00:20:14.131 --> 00:20:16.382
I didn't think you were

00:20:14.131 --> 00:20:16.382
gonna be able to pull it off,

00:20:16.424 --> 00:20:17.634
but you did it.

00:20:17.675 --> 00:20:19.719
You saved my life.

00:20:19.761 --> 00:20:22.472
And for that,

00:20:19.761 --> 00:20:22.472
I shall be forever grateful.

00:20:22.513 --> 00:20:25.934
Hey, I couldn't imagine life

00:20:22.513 --> 00:20:25.934
without you, buddy.

00:20:25.976 --> 00:20:29.187
You know, I forgot what a

00:20:25.976 --> 00:20:29.187
man cave I had in Lois's uterus.

00:20:29.228 --> 00:20:31.064
While I was waiting for

00:20:29.228 --> 00:20:31.064
you, I was shooting pool.

00:20:31.106 --> 00:20:34.192
Had to hold the cue at

00:20:31.106 --> 00:20:34.192
weird angles, but still.

00:20:38.029 --> 00:20:40.698
Oh, Peter, isn't he amazing?

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:43.785
Is he smart, or is he...

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:43.785
like me?

00:20:43.827 --> 00:20:46.621
He's perfect.

00:20:54.253 --> 00:20:55.546
CHRIS:

00:20:54.253 --> 00:20:55.546
<i>You guys heard the baby</i>

00:20:55.588 --> 00:20:57.090
<i>talking in there, didn't you?</i>

00:20:57.132 --> 00:20:58.758
LOIS:

00:20:57.132 --> 00:20:58.758
<i>Chris, that's ridiculous.</i>